{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"act44side_level_act44side_08_end","storyGroup":"act44side","storySort":18,"storyDependence":"act44side_level_act44side_08_beg","storyCanShow":1,"storyCode":"AT-8","storyName":"逝川","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"在锻冶町的河边，漫天的花火下面，三船痛陈这些年他对铁斋等人积攒的扭曲的仇恨，又在最终对决前表现出一丝疲惫和怀念。听着这早已不再是故乡的御机的现状，星熊周身燃起怒火，不只指向三船，也不只为了铁斋。","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"activities/act44side/level_act44side_08_end","avgTag":"行动后","unLockType":"BY_START_TIME","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"act44side_08","minState":"PASS","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"prev":16,"next":18,"characters":["悲痛的黑道","星熊","三船","？？？","萌萌香","吉星","森内"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"stopmusic","id":1},{"type":"dialog","id":2},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":3},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":4},{"type":"charslot","id":5},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","amount":"1","keep":"true","id":6},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$loneliness_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/static/m_avg/m_avg_loneliness_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":7,"musicid":0},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/97/Avg_bg_64_g17_jindaalley_n.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":8},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":9},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":10},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1906_1#1$1","duration":"1","isblock":"true","id":11},{"type":"dialogue","name":"悲痛的黑道","text":"鬼姐，我最后跟你说一次，不能再往前走了！","id":12,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0b/Avg_avg_npc_1906_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":13},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"我必须去救下那个人。","id":14},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1906_1#1$1","id":15},{"type":"dialogue","name":"悲痛的黑道","text":"鬼姐！！","id":16,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0b/Avg_avg_npc_1906_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":17},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"没时间了。我最后说一次，让开。","id":18},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1906_1#1$1","id":19},{"type":"dialogue","name":"悲痛的黑道","text":"你真的还是鬼姐吗？你身上还有一点人味儿吗？","id":20,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0b/Avg_avg_npc_1906_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":21},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"我......为什么不是鬼姐？","id":22},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":23},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1906_1#1$1","id":24},{"type":"dialogue","name":"悲痛的黑道","text":"修司已经死了，死在你的刀下！","id":25,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0b/Avg_avg_npc_1906_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":26},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"修司......他......？","id":27},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1906_1#1$1","id":28},{"type":"dialogue","name":"悲痛的黑道","text":"你不再是原来那个鬼姐了......你是鬼，你是恶鬼......","id":29,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0b/Avg_avg_npc_1906_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"悲痛的黑道","text":"哪怕是一同喝酒的家人，但凡挡在你的面前，你就会像砍陌生人一样，毫无顾忌地砍死......","id":30,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0b/Avg_avg_npc_1906_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"悲痛的黑道","text":"恶鬼！现在我挡在你的面前，你还要杀了我吗？","id":31,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0b/Avg_avg_npc_1906_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":32},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"高太郎......让开。","id":33},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"我不能就这么回去。我得阻止金兵卫，我无论如何都得阻止金兵卫！","id":34},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":35},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1906_1#1$1","id":36},{"type":"dialogue","name":"悲痛的黑道","text":"恶鬼！！","id":37,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0b/Avg_avg_npc_1906_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":38},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_clothmovement","volume":"1","id":39},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","action":"zoom","poszoom":"0.5,0.5","scale":"1.05","duration":"0.2","id":40},{"type":"charslot","duration":"0.2","id":41},{"type":"delay","time":"0.2","id":42},{"type":"text","text":"自己下意识地举起刀，只是摆了一个刀刃向前的架势。","id":43},{"type":"text","text":"而眼前的人举着刀朝自己猛冲过来，甚至像是主动撞上来一样，把胸膛送到了自己的刀尖之上。","id":44},{"type":"text","text":"是主动撞上来的，还是自己拨开了他的刀，然后......？","id":45},{"type":"dialogue","name":"悲痛的黑道","text":"恶......鬼......","id":46},{"type":"dialogue","name":"悲痛的黑道","text":"下......地狱去吧......","id":47},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"恶鬼？","id":48},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"我......恶鬼？","id":49},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"鬼？","id":50},{"type":"dialog","id":51},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":52},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0.03","block":"true","id":53},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.5","xstrength":"20","ystrength":"20","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":54},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_swordchop_xshield","volume":"1","id":55},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":56},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":57},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_broadswordblood","id":58},{"type":"charslot","duration":"0.2","id":59},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":60},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":61},{"type":"charslot","id":62},{"type":"background","id":63},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c0/Avg_64_i11.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":64},{"type":"imagetween","xScaleFrom":"1.1","yScaleFrom":"1.1","xScaleTo":"1","yScaleTo":"1","duration":"20","block":"false","id":65},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":66},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"4","block":"true","id":67},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":68},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","fadetime":"10","keep":"true","initamount":"1","amount":"0","block":"false","id":69},{"type":"text","text":"鲜血。满目的鲜血。血迷了她的眼。","id":70},{"type":"text","text":"有人朝自己冲过来，那就斩断。","id":71},{"type":"text","text":"有武器朝自己挥过来，那就反击。","id":72},{"type":"text","text":"更多的哭声，喊声，武器划破夜幕的风声，杂乱的声音在她胸中搅成无首无尾的一团，和心脏一同搏动，搏动，搏动——","id":73},{"type":"text","text":"直到那团声音彻底与她的心跳声共振，盖过了耳边响起的所有声音。","id":74},{"type":"text","text":"几乎失了神智的恶鬼就这样一路走，一路斩，一路留下鲜血与尸骸，一路走到那间破旧的房前，一脚把门踢开。","id":75},{"type":"text","text":"那里没有声音。","id":76},{"type":"dialog","id":77},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":78},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":79},{"type":"charslot","id":80},{"type":"image","id":81},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","amount":"1","keep":"true","id":82},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/97/Avg_bg_64_g17_jindaalley_n.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":83},{"type":"bg","id":84,"from":"0","to":"1","duration":"0.1","block":"false"},{"type":"bgeffect","name":"$eb_bloodfalling","layer":"1","id":85},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":86},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":87},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":88},{"type":"text","text":"于是，恶鬼就这样站在门口，侧着头，仿佛在谛听从地狱传来的，常人根本无法听见的声音。","id":89},{"type":"text","text":"直到一个颤抖着的声音响起。","id":90},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"......死了。","id":91},{"type":"text","text":"谁死了？","id":92},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"议员候选人......死了。","id":93},{"type":"text","text":"议员候选人死了？","id":94},{"type":"text","text":"哭声远去，喊声远去，武器的破空声远去，心跳也远去，一切声音都离她而去。","id":95},{"type":"text","text":"只有那些从地狱传来的声音，比任何时候都清晰地回响在她耳边。","id":96},{"type":"text","text":"鬼。","id":97},{"type":"text","text":"恶鬼。","id":98},{"type":"text","text":"下地狱去吧。","id":99},{"type":"text","text":"......","id":100},{"type":"dialog","id":101},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":102},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":103},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":104},{"type":"charslot","id":105},{"type":"bgeffect","id":106},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/88/Avg_bg_64_g16_jindadike.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":107},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","amount":"0","keep":"true","id":108},{"type":"bg","id":109,"from":"1","to":"0","duration":"0.1","block":"false"},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_firework_amb","volume":"0","loop":"true","channel":"f","id":110},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"0.3","channel":"f","fadetime":"2","id":111},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":112},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":113},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":114},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_hidehaystack","volume":"1","id":115},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1896_1#1$1","duration":"1.5","isblock":"true","id":116},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":117},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_darkduel_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":118,"musicid":1},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"就在这里。","id":119,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c1/Avg_avg_npc_1896_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"我没把位置选在刚刚那一路的废墟里，特意挑了这块河边上的荒地，免得你触景生情。不用感谢我。","id":120,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c1/Avg_avg_npc_1896_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":121},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":122},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1896_1#9$1","id":123},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"我们来得真是时候。花火大会还没结束。","id":124,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/73/Avg_avg_npc_1896_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1044_hsgma2_1#4$2","id":125},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"......","id":126,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f6/Avg_avg_1044_hsgma2_1-4$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1896_1#9$1","id":127},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"怎么，临要动手，反而又迟疑了？","id":128,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/73/Avg_avg_npc_1896_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1044_hsgma2_1#5$2","id":129},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"不。","id":130,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8a/Avg_avg_1044_hsgma2_1-5$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"我只是想在动手之前，把一切都问清楚。","id":131,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8a/Avg_avg_1044_hsgma2_1-5$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1896_1#1$1","id":132},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"还有什么事不清楚？","id":133,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c1/Avg_avg_npc_1896_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1044_hsgma2_1#2$2","id":134},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"只有一件事。","id":135,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e9/Avg_avg_1044_hsgma2_1-2$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1044_hsgma2_1#7$2","id":136},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"你的恨，从何而来？","id":137,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8f/Avg_avg_1044_hsgma2_1-7$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"我在电视台遇见哲也了。我听他说了铁斋叔死时的事。你本可以不那么残忍。","id":138,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8f/Avg_avg_1044_hsgma2_1-7$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"我不知道铁斋叔这些年是怎么对你的，但你能走到架空他的这一步，他至少应该没有把你当成假想敌。","id":139,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8f/Avg_avg_1044_hsgma2_1-7$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"而我，我自认为对你仁至义尽。甚至在我刚回御机的时候，我想的不过是，希望自己的牺牲不要毫无意义——","id":140,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8f/Avg_avg_1044_hsgma2_1-7$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1896_1#9$1","id":141},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"牺牲？","id":142,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/73/Avg_avg_npc_1896_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1896_1#6$1","id":143},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"对，这就是你，还有铁斋，你们最让我作呕的地方。","id":144,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2f/Avg_avg_npc_1896_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"你是个傻瓜，他比你更傻。哪怕真是你误杀了议员候选人，他难道不知道用当时也在房间里的我顶罪吗？","id":145,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2f/Avg_avg_npc_1896_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"他偏爱你，所以我一直在等，等他哪天让我去把杀人的罪责“顶下来”。","id":146,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2f/Avg_avg_npc_1896_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"至少在当时，这是对他最好的结果，他保了自己偏爱的你，拔除了敢背着他擅自行动的我。","id":147,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2f/Avg_avg_npc_1896_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"至于所谓“杀了兄弟的人”，那重要吗？般若在你手里，他的支持在你背后，谁敢嚼这种不要命的舌头？！","id":148,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2f/Avg_avg_npc_1896_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1044_hsgma2_1#7$2","id":149},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"......","id":150,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8f/Avg_avg_1044_hsgma2_1-7$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1896_1#2$1","id":151},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"结果，他却选了大义灭亲，选了“任侠”......简直让人想吐。","id":152,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e8/Avg_avg_npc_1896_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1896_1#1$1","id":153},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"他是真不知道，还是装不知道，金石会的会长大位，是全天下离“侠”字最远的地方？","id":154,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c1/Avg_avg_npc_1896_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"星熊，任侠是一个人的事。一群任侠，要么散伙了事，要么就只是一帮社会渣滓在自欺欺人。","id":155,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c1/Avg_avg_npc_1896_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"铁斋总喜欢吹嘘他自己。他说，黑道都是些可怜人，是只有在组织的庇护下才能活下去的不被接纳的人。","id":156,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c1/Avg_avg_npc_1896_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"退役的老兵，混混，赌徒，摊贩，孤儿，铁斋用金石会的名号把所有人聚在一起，希望他们能像家人一样爱彼此......","id":157,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c1/Avg_avg_npc_1896_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"那一夜之前的事我都不论，就说议员候选人死后，岛须要挟我，乡田暗中拔除我的势力，佐野口像当年排挤你一样排挤我......","id":158,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c1/Avg_avg_npc_1896_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1896_1#6$1","id":159},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"家人？我的铁斋老爷子，这个梦怕不是只有你一个人在做吧！","id":160,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2f/Avg_avg_npc_1896_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"再说这不就是给自己适应不了社会这件事找借口吗，星熊警官？如果他说的是真的，你算什么，我又算什么？","id":161,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2f/Avg_avg_npc_1896_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1044_hsgma2_1#7$2","id":162},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"如果你这样就叫做适应社会，呵，我很庆幸当年是我背下了责任。","id":163,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8f/Avg_avg_1044_hsgma2_1-7$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1896_1#9$1","id":164},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"哈哈，你终于说了句对的话，身在福中不知福的星熊警官！","id":165,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/73/Avg_avg_npc_1896_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1896_1#1$1","id":166},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"你背下了责任，你走了，而我选择沉默，我留了下来，我来面对你和铁斋留下的巨大的烂摊子。","id":167,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c1/Avg_avg_npc_1896_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"帮会成员杀了议员候选人，引来群情激愤？那就去付出金钱、产业、尊严，去结交真正的议员。","id":168,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c1/Avg_avg_npc_1896_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"新兴的电视媒体搞舆论轰炸？那就借着晶体工业去办自己的媒体，扭转极道的形象。","id":169,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c1/Avg_avg_npc_1896_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"产业大到一定规模，开始引人觊觎？那就放低身段，咬定最能利用自己的人。","id":170,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c1/Avg_avg_npc_1896_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"遇到了无论如何也没法摆平的人？那就只有消灭一途。","id":171,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c1/Avg_avg_npc_1896_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1044_hsgma2_1#7$2","id":172},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"你在抱怨？这不是你自己选的？","id":173,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8f/Avg_avg_1044_hsgma2_1-7$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1896_1#6$1","id":174},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"对，我自己选的。我鬼迷了心窍，才在那一夜闭口不言！","id":175,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2f/Avg_avg_npc_1896_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1044_hsgma2_1#7$2","id":176},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"你自己选了耻辱，选了扭曲，选了良心的谴责——","id":177,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8f/Avg_avg_1044_hsgma2_1-7$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1896_1#10$1","id":178},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"良心的谴责？！","id":179,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bf/Avg_avg_npc_1896_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1896_1#6$1","id":180},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"错了，星熊警官！","id":181,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2f/Avg_avg_npc_1896_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"我选的这条路，是让我彻彻底底看清铁斋究竟有多无能，他口中的任侠有多虚伪，他带领的金石会离灭亡有多近的路！","id":182,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2f/Avg_avg_npc_1896_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"他是个最无能、最昏聩的棋手，到了即将被整个时代将死的时候，就开始为了他的金石会，不停地弃子。","id":183,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2f/Avg_avg_npc_1896_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"你的事是一切的先声，那时议员这个概念刚刚出现，你已经被他抛出去了。","id":184,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2f/Avg_avg_npc_1896_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"在南北关系最微妙的时候，他居然为了剿灭一个在他看来行为不端，武器却比金石会精良的帮派，傻到去找北院的势力购买军火。","id":185,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2f/Avg_avg_npc_1896_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1896_1#3$1","id":186},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"哦对，那不过是那群灭了他满门的“流浪的恶鬼”曾经藏身的帮派罢了，和他实际上根本没有什么深仇大恨。","id":187,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bd/Avg_avg_npc_1896_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1896_1#9$1","id":188},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"他看起来是要给死掉的老婆孩子雪仇，结果，哈，哲也的母亲也被他抛出去，连哲也都恨上他了。","id":189,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/73/Avg_avg_npc_1896_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1896_1#6$1","id":190},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"更别说我了，假如不是我这个二把手不信他这套愚蠢的任侠，我也已经被他抛出去无数次了！","id":191,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2f/Avg_avg_npc_1896_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"一切都证明，我才是对的，而他，他就像是个错把自己当成王将的最愚蠢的步兵，只知道前方是敌阵，就傻乎乎地直冲过去......","id":192,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2f/Avg_avg_npc_1896_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"他以为等着自己的是升变？错了，所有人，无论敌我，都在向着和他相反的方向进发，他的面前，只有死路一条！","id":193,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2f/Avg_avg_npc_1896_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"帮这样一个蠢货力挽狂澜，帮他收拾残局，还要被他骑在头顶作威作福，被他指手画脚？","id":194,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2f/Avg_avg_npc_1896_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":195},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1896_1#7$1","id":196},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"我宁可那天晚上你狂性大发，把我也砍死，也算干净！","id":197,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6f/Avg_avg_npc_1896_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1044_hsgma2_1#4$2","id":198},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"......","id":199,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f6/Avg_avg_1044_hsgma2_1-4$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1896_1#6$1","id":200},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"这样你满意了吗？有足够的理由用你的刀或者盾往我身上招呼了吗？","id":201,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2f/Avg_avg_npc_1896_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1044_hsgma2_1#2$2","id":202},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"我只想问，你在表演吗？","id":203,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e9/Avg_avg_1044_hsgma2_1-2$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1896_1#1$1","id":204},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"......演？","id":205,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c1/Avg_avg_npc_1896_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1044_hsgma2_1#4$2","id":206},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"你说当年他要是把你推出去，就能稳固自己的势力，我同意。","id":207,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f6/Avg_avg_1044_hsgma2_1-4$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"你说金石会的会长大位其实离任侠很远，我能理解。","id":208,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f6/Avg_avg_1044_hsgma2_1-4$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"你说金石会摇摇欲坠，是你力挽狂澜，铁斋叔甚至还成了你的绊脚石，让你越来越愤怒，我信。","id":209,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f6/Avg_avg_1044_hsgma2_1-4$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1896_1#6$1","id":210},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"那你究竟还想说什么？","id":211,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2f/Avg_avg_npc_1896_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1044_hsgma2_1#2$2","id":212},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"我只是已经分不清了。","id":213,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e9/Avg_avg_1044_hsgma2_1-2$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"亲昵地带我回锻冶町的人是你，想把我逼到失去理智，彻底除掉我的人也是你。","id":214,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e9/Avg_avg_1044_hsgma2_1-2$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"让哲也死心塌地的人是你，让他亲眼见证你如何逼死他父亲的，也是你。","id":215,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e9/Avg_avg_1044_hsgma2_1-2$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"在铁斋叔面前不惜断指的人是你，连他死后还要咒骂他的无能的人，还是你。","id":216,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e9/Avg_avg_1044_hsgma2_1-2$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"你刚刚的剖白很清晰、很合理，我完全理解你在说什么，理解你为什么会一步步走到今天。","id":217,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e9/Avg_avg_1044_hsgma2_1-2$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1044_hsgma2_1#5$2","id":218},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"但越清晰，越合理，越明白，我就越不敢相信......","id":219,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8a/Avg_avg_1044_hsgma2_1-5$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1044_hsgma2_1#7$2","id":220},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"这真的是你吗？还是说，这也不过是你为了让我相信你是这样的人，而为自己谋划的一场疯狂的谢幕？","id":221,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8f/Avg_avg_1044_hsgma2_1-7$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"那天你在锻冶町切下了左手小指，铁斋叔说你一定是演的，我当时不信。","id":222,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8f/Avg_avg_1044_hsgma2_1-7$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"但我现在真的很想知道，你的左手手套下面......真的只有四根指头吗？","id":223,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8f/Avg_avg_1044_hsgma2_1-7$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1896_1#1$1","id":224},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"......","id":225,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c1/Avg_avg_npc_1896_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":226},{"type":"text","text":"斐迪亚一怔。","id":227},{"type":"text","text":"他死死地瞪着星熊的眼，仿佛在等待星熊先别开视线。","id":228},{"type":"text","text":"在意识到这无济于事之后，他轻轻笑了一声，炫耀似的把左手摊开在自己面前，缓缓摘下手套。","id":229},{"type":"text","text":"本该空无一物的小指位置，一根显然并非血肉，而是机械的小指，正在不住颤动。","id":230},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1896_1#9$1","id":231},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"我本想告诉你，我切掉的那根指头跟了我几十年，但你不会信了，是吗？","id":232,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/73/Avg_avg_npc_1896_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1044_hsgma2_1#7$2","id":233},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"......","id":234,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8f/Avg_avg_1044_hsgma2_1-7$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1896_1#10$1","id":235},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"哈哈......好，很好。","id":236,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bf/Avg_avg_npc_1896_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1044_hsgma2_1#7$2","id":237},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"你刚刚说了这么多，只有一句话，我觉得还算有点价值。","id":238,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8f/Avg_avg_1044_hsgma2_1-7$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1044_hsgma2_1#4$2","id":239},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"任侠......是一个人的事。","id":240,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f6/Avg_avg_1044_hsgma2_1-4$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":241},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":242},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1896_1#9$1","id":243},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"说完了？","id":244,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/73/Avg_avg_npc_1896_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1044_hsgma2_1#2$2","id":245},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"是啊，说完了。","id":246,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e9/Avg_avg_1044_hsgma2_1-2$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"你用来最后一搏的帮手呢？是时候叫他们出来了。","id":247,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e9/Avg_avg_1044_hsgma2_1-2$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1896_1#9$1","id":248},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"这里只有我。没有帮手，没有陷阱，没有机关。","id":249,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/73/Avg_avg_npc_1896_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1044_hsgma2_1#1$2","id":250},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"传媒大亨，政客的联络人，金石会的会长，就这么看轻自己的生命？","id":251,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ed/Avg_avg_1044_hsgma2_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1896_1#10$1","id":252},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"大亨？我很快就不是了。","id":253,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bf/Avg_avg_npc_1896_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"政客？这条路被你亲手掐断。","id":254,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bf/Avg_avg_npc_1896_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1896_1#9$1","id":255},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"所谓金石会的会长？继任仪式不是你搅的局吗？","id":256,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/73/Avg_avg_npc_1896_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"如果你觉得我一直在演，那么，恭喜你，我终于累了。","id":257,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/73/Avg_avg_npc_1896_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1896_1#1$1","id":258},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"我现在只是个黑道。被逼到死角，困兽犹斗的黑道。","id":259,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c1/Avg_avg_npc_1896_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"既然只能以这样的身份死去，我宁愿死得干净利索，死得......漂亮。","id":260,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c1/Avg_avg_npc_1896_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1044_hsgma2_1#2$2","id":261},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"哪怕你在这之前做的每一件事，都和任侠二字背道而驰？","id":262,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e9/Avg_avg_1044_hsgma2_1-2$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1896_1#9$1","id":263},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"我说的不是“侠义”，不是“任侠”，不是你和铁斋脑子里生了锈的老古董，星熊。","id":264,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/73/Avg_avg_npc_1896_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"我说的是，漂亮。","id":265,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/73/Avg_avg_npc_1896_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1896_1#1$1","id":266},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"即将发生的事也许跟给一个儿子看他父亲如何为他而死没法比，但你得承认......","id":267,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c1/Avg_avg_npc_1896_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"荒野，河岸，烟火，还有四溅的鲜血，或许还有高高飞起的头颅，这些毕竟是美的。","id":268,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c1/Avg_avg_npc_1896_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"别担心，星熊，死的未必是我。如果丧命的是你，我也会承认，作为黑道，你给自己亲手写了一个很美的结局。","id":269,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c1/Avg_avg_npc_1896_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1044_hsgma2_1#7$2","id":270},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"抱歉，我不需要这个头衔。","id":271,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8f/Avg_avg_1044_hsgma2_1-7$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"我与你交手只为了一件事，为了斩断与你，与金石会，与御机，与东国的因缘。","id":272,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8f/Avg_avg_1044_hsgma2_1-7$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1896_1#9$1","id":273},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"哈，无妨，可要是你不幸死在我的刀下，我又该如何传唱这场死亡？我砍死了谁？一个鬼？","id":274,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/73/Avg_avg_npc_1896_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1044_hsgma2_1#4$2","id":275},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"一个鬼。","id":276,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f6/Avg_avg_1044_hsgma2_1-4$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1044_hsgma2_1#7$2","id":277},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"一个永远失去了故乡的鬼。","id":278,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8f/Avg_avg_1044_hsgma2_1-7$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":279},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":280},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":281},{"type":"charslot","id":282},{"type":"background","id":283},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/56/Avg_64_i10_1.png","screenadapt":"coverall","xScale":"1.2","yScale":"1.2","id":284},{"type":"imagetween","image":"64_i10_1","xScaleFrom":"1.2","yScaleFrom":"1.2","xScaleTo":"1.18","yScaleTo":"1.18","xFrom":"80","xTo":"0","duration":"14","id":285},{"type":"cgitem","image":"cgitem_64_i10","style":"cg","pfrom":"280,0","pto":"350,0","pduration":"15","sfrom":"1.4","sto":"1.3","sduration":"15","layer":"1","id":286},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":287},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"1","channel":"f","fadetime":"2","id":288},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_drawtheknife_long","volume":"1","id":289},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":290},{"type":"text","text":"三船不再说话。","id":291},{"type":"text","text":"他拔出那把对一般人来说长得过分，但对他而言似乎正好的大太刀。","id":292},{"type":"text","text":"那刀刃锋利如雪，却被夜色掩映，宛如随时都会融化的，不该出现在夏夜的霜。","id":293},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"星熊，我突然在想。","id":294},{"type":"text","text":"他声音里从未散去的那股浮夸，忽然消失无踪。","id":295},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"......","id":296},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"之前，也是在这条河边，我们都年轻的时候，铁斋曾经在这里带着我们看雪。","id":297},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"我记得。","id":298},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"他说，别因为自己是黑道就看不起自己。","id":299},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"他说我们是武家的孑遗。他说，从鬼菖蒲重一开始，一代又一代的武士为了忠义献身，直到我们这些人。","id":300},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"他说哪怕没有高贵的地位，没有煊赫的权势，没有效忠的对象，甚至，没有武家的血脉......","id":301},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"但忠义不会消失，武家的魂灵不会消失。","id":302},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"仁义。侠义。任侠。","id":303},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"哪怕武家的魂灵已经式微，哪怕它已经扭曲，已经换过许多名字，哪怕我们之间没有血缘，但是，那魂灵一直在。","id":304},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"星熊，他胡说，他也在演，对不对？","id":305},{"type":"text","text":"三船直勾勾地盯着星熊的眼睛。","id":306},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"......","id":307},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"你不知道？","id":308},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"我只信一件事。","id":309},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"能让你如此痛恨的他，不会演戏给你看。","id":310},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"好。","id":311},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"你信他，我信你。我信铁斋没有骗我。我信我们就是现在这座南院行在御机大社里，武家最后的孑遗。","id":312},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"而那些家名家纹代代相传的真正的武家，现在......","id":313},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"哈，大概正在炒房地产吧。","id":314},{"type":"text","text":"金兵卫低低地笑了一声。","id":315},{"type":"dialog","id":316},{"type":"playsound","key":"$firestorm","volume":"1","id":317},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":318},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":319},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_churchfire","volume":"0","loop":"true","channel":"c","id":320},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"0.6","channel":"c","fadetime":"2","id":321},{"type":"hidecgitem","image":"cgitem_64_i10","id":322},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a4/Avg_64_i10_2.png","screenadapt":"coverall","xScale":"1.1","yScale":"1.1","id":323},{"type":"imagetween","xScaleFrom":"1.1","yScaleFrom":"1.1","xScaleTo":"1","yScaleTo":"1","duration":"10","block":"false","id":324},{"type":"delay","time":"0.1","id":325},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":326},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":327},{"type":"text","text":"而在他对面，青色的怒火，正在星熊周身熊熊燃烧。","id":328},{"type":"text","text":"那火已经不再为金兵卫而燃，却越烧越旺，越烧越旺，几乎要烧穿御机那明亮得令人窒息的夜空——","id":329},{"type":"dialog","id":330},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"c","fadetime":"2","id":331},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"f","fadetime":"2","id":332},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":333},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":334},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":335},{"type":"image","id":336},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/88/Avg_bg_64_g16_jindadike.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":337},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.1","block":"true","id":338},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_cutin_final","volume":"1","id":339},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_wtchkgmgcbfr","volume":"1","id":340},{"type":"interlude","maskid":"ui_cutin_mask_horizon","size":"1300,360","style":"3","offset":"0,180","channel":"3","id":341},{"type":"1","channel":"3","slot":"m","direction":"rin","pfrom":"0,180","pto":"-200,180","sfrom":"1.5,1.5","sto":"1,1","sduration":"0.3","name":"cutin_char_21","duration":"1","id":342},{"type":"2","channel":"3","name":"64_g16_jindadike_l","pfrom":"0,180","pto":"0,180","duration":"1","id":343},{"type":"interlude","maskid":"ui_cutin_mask_horizon","size":"1300,360","style":"3","offset":"0,-180","channel":"4","id":344},{"type":"1","channel":"4","slot":"m","direction":"lin","pfrom":"0,-180","pto":"200,-180","sfrom":"1.5,1.5","sto":"1,1","sduration":"0.3","name":"cutin_char_22","duration":"1","id":345},{"type":"2","channel":"4","name":"64_g16_jindadike_r","pfrom":"0,0","pto":"0,0","duration":"1","id":346},{"type":"background","id":347},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":348},{"type":"playsound","key":"$e_skill_skulsrsword","volume":"1","id":349},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_katanaflash_final","volume":"1","id":350},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.5","xstrength":"50","ystrength":"50","vibrato":"90","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":351},{"type":"avgdisplay","id":352,"style":"effect","name":"$e_064cg_slash","slot":"bgover","layer":"1"},{"type":"cgitem","image":"cgitem_64_i18_1","style":"cg","pfrom":"600,0","pto":"-1100,0","pduration":"0.5","sfrom":"1.7","sto":"1.8","sduration":"0.1","layer":"3","id":353},{"type":"cgitem","image":"cgitem_64_i18_2","style":"cg","pfrom":"-600,0","pto":"1100,0","pduration":"0.5","sfrom":"1.7","sto":"1.8","sduration":"0.1","layer":"2","id":354},{"type":"delay","time":"0.2","id":355},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_grass","volume":"1","id":356},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":357},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0.05","block":"true","id":358},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":359},{"type":"delay","time":"1.8","id":360},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":361},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.1","block":"true","id":362},{"type":"hidecgitem","image":"cgitem_64_i18_1","id":363},{"type":"hidecgitem","image":"cgitem_64_i18_2","id":364},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f3/Avg_64_i18.png","screenadapt":"coverall","xScale":"1.05","yScale":"1.05","fadetime":"0","id":365},{"type":"imagetween","xScaleFrom":"1.05","yScaleFrom":"1.05","xScaleTo":"1","yScaleTo":"1","duration":"20","block":"false","id":366},{"type":"text","text":"一切在不到一次呼吸的瞬间内结束。","id":367},{"type":"dialog","id":368},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_firework_huge","volume":"1","id":369},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":370},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":371},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":372},{"type":"text","text":"两人背对着背，站位几乎完全掉了个个。","id":373},{"type":"text","text":"星熊缓缓把刀收入鞘中。","id":374},{"type":"text","text":"而金兵卫的身躯越来越低，越来越低，直到支撑不住，倒在地上。","id":375},{"type":"dialog","id":376},{"type":"playsound","key":"$bodyfalldown1","id":377},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"0.3","channel":"f","fadetime":"2","id":378},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":379},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":380},{"type":"charslot","id":381},{"type":"image","id":382},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_monastery_nomal.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":383,"musicid":2},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/88/Avg_bg_64_g16_jindadike.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":384},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1044_hsgma2_1#4$4","id":385},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":386},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_firework_amb","volume":"0","loop":"true","channel":"f","id":387},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"1","channel":"f","fadetime":"2","id":388},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":389},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":390},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":391},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"你......没受伤？","id":392},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1044_hsgma2_1#2$4","id":393},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"脸上划了一道。","id":394,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4f/Avg_avg_1044_hsgma2_1-2$4.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":395},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"我呢？","id":396},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"我能感受到自己在流血，星熊。但我不想去看。","id":397},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"告诉我，我还有多长时间会死？","id":398},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1044_hsgma2_1#4$4","id":399},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"我不知道。","id":400,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ee/Avg_avg_1044_hsgma2_1-4$4.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"我想，在我走之后，很快就会有人来到这里，那样，你大概还能活，活很久。","id":401,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ee/Avg_avg_1044_hsgma2_1-4$4.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":402},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"为什么留手？","id":403},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1044_hsgma2_1#4$4","id":404},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"你我之间已经再无瓜葛。","id":405,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ee/Avg_avg_1044_hsgma2_1-4$4.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"铁斋叔的仇，萌萌香的恨，自然有其他人替我去审判。","id":406,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ee/Avg_avg_1044_hsgma2_1-4$4.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":407},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"哈、哈哈......","id":408},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"这么多年过去，终究还是......你赢了。","id":409},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1044_hsgma2_1#10$4","id":410},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"不，我输了，我输得很彻底。","id":411,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/91/Avg_avg_1044_hsgma2_1-10$4.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"一败涂地。","id":412,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/91/Avg_avg_1044_hsgma2_1-10$4.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":413},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"这座城市现在的样子，就这么让你讨厌？","id":414},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1044_hsgma2_1#10$4","id":415},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"它只是彻底背离了我回忆中的样貌。","id":416,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/91/Avg_avg_1044_hsgma2_1-10$4.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"它不是我的家了。就这样。","id":417,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/91/Avg_avg_1044_hsgma2_1-10$4.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":418},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_firemagic","volume":"0.3","id":419},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"2","id":420},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1044_hsgma2_1#10$2","posfrom":"200,0","posto":"200,0","duration":"1.5","id":421},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":422},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1044_hsgma2_1#4$2","id":423},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"永别了。","id":424,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f6/Avg_avg_1044_hsgma2_1-4$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":425},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_hidehaystack","volume":"1","id":426},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1.5","isblock":"true","id":427},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":428},{"type":"text","text":"星熊转身走向锻冶町荒芜的废墟。","id":429},{"type":"text","text":"而倒在地上的金兵卫一边感受着失血的寒意，一边抬眼望向对岸。","id":430},{"type":"text","text":"那边的嘈杂与喧嚣，正冷冷地俯视着河道这边，马上就要变得光鲜亮丽的荒滩。","id":431},{"type":"dialog","id":432},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"f","fadetime":"3","id":433},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":434},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":435},{"type":"charslot","id":436},{"type":"background","id":437},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9e/Avg_64_i12.png","screenadapt":"coverall","xScale":"1.1","yScale":"1.1","fadetime":"0","id":438},{"type":"imagetween","xScaleFrom":"1.1","yScaleFrom":"1.1","xScaleTo":"1","yScaleTo":"1","duration":"20","block":"false","id":439},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":440},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_wtchkgopenftstp","volume":"1","id":441},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":442},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":443},{"type":"text","text":"独角的鬼走过古旧建筑的废墟，走过冷漠地喧嚣着的欢乐街，走过先前还与自己刀剑相向的敌人，走入晦暗而刺目的夜色。","id":444},{"type":"text","text":"凉爽的夜风从背后吹来，带来如同解脱般的轻松，把许多不属于现在的声音送到她的耳边。","id":445},{"type":"text","text":"坏心眼的摊主，跟父亲打了招呼，带着坏笑递给自己用一沾水就破掉的纸做的网子，招呼自己从水中捞鳞。","id":446},{"type":"text","text":"父亲去世后那个夏夜，铁斋叔塞在自己手里的，跟自己那时的年龄已经不相称的，根本就无从下口，只能慢慢舔的苹果糖。","id":447},{"type":"text","text":"被自己嫌弃幼稚，却怎么也套不中，不知道被施了什么法术的套圈。","id":448},{"type":"text","text":"和金石会的人喝得上了头，一股脑涌向打靶摊，那摊子上的奖品明明全是便宜货，招牌上却写着“拉特兰圣城”......","id":449},{"type":"text","text":"她一步一步地朝着这些东国夏夜的风物诗走去。","id":450},{"type":"text","text":"但那些早已被时间带走的虚影只是从她身边擦过，和那些先前倒在她手下的人一同后退，后退......","id":451},{"type":"text","text":"还有花火。","id":452},{"type":"text","text":"是了，还有花火。错过今夜的花火大会之后，或许从此以后再也无法得见的，东国夏夜的花火。","id":453},{"type":"dialog","id":454},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":455},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":456},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":457},{"type":"image","id":458},{"type":"bgeffect","name":"$eb_firework_senkou","layer":"1","id":459},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":460},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_noisycitytraffic","volume":"0","loop":"true","channel":"no","id":461},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"0.4","channel":"no","fadetime":"2","id":462},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_fireworks_small","volume":"0","loop":"true","channel":"fi","id":463},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"1","channel":"fi","fadetime":"2","id":464},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":465},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":466},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"fi","fadetime":"6","id":467},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"所以，你完全没看到花火大会上的烟火吗？","id":468},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"跟没看到没什么区别。","id":469},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"欸？你把一整场花火大会都错过去了？","id":470},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"嗯。","id":471},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"太遗憾了，那......","id":472},{"type":"dialog","id":473},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"no","fadetime":"4","id":474},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":475},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":476},{"type":"charslot","id":477},{"type":"bgeffect","id":478},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$warm_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act9d0d0/m_avg_warm_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":479,"musicid":3},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d4/Avg_64_i13.png","screenadapt":"coverall","xScale":"1.5","yScale":"1.5","y":"-50","fadetime":"0","id":480},{"type":"imagetween","xFrom":"300","xTo":"320","duration":"10","block":"false","id":481},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":482},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":483},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":484},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萌萌香","text":"那你......至少看到了这个。","id":485},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萌萌香","text":"我搞不来那么漂亮的烟花，整个仁田街跑了个遍，也只能买到这种拿在手里的不起眼小东西......","id":486},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萌萌香","text":"你可别伤心啊。","id":487},{"type":"dialog","id":488},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d4/Avg_64_i13.png","screenadapt":"coverall","xScale":"1.5","yScale":"1.5","y":"-150","fadetime":"2","id":489},{"type":"imagetween","xFrom":"-300","xTo":"-320","duration":"10","block":"false","id":490},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":491},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"......","id":492},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"我怎么会伤心呢。","id":493},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萌萌香","text":"那就太好了。","id":494},{"type":"dialog","id":495},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d4/Avg_64_i13.png","screenadapt":"coverall","xScale":"1.05","yScale":"1.05","fadetime":"2","id":496},{"type":"imagetween","xScaleFrom":"1.05","yScaleFrom":"1.05","xScaleTo":"1","yScaleTo":"1","duration":"20","block":"false","id":497},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":498},{"type":"text","text":"意料之外的人带着意料之外的笑脸，手中拿着意料之外的礼物，站在自己面前。","id":499},{"type":"text","text":"星熊忽然觉得眼眶一热。","id":500},{"type":"text","text":"眼前小小的烟花，显得比整座城市还要明亮些许。","id":501},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"真漂亮啊。","id":502},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萌萌香","text":"嗯，马上就要燃尽，但......真的很漂亮。","id":503},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"吉星、更纱和森内他们呢？还有哲也呢？","id":504},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萌萌香","text":"吉星和森内老板还在被那个一脸过劳相的警察问话，再过一会儿大概也就出来了。","id":505},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萌萌香","text":"更纱在遇到警察前一个路口突然睡了过去，睡前让我们不用管她。等我见到警察，回去找她的时候，她已经不见了。","id":506},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萌萌香","text":"至于哲也......我不知道。","id":507},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"对了，得通知警察，金兵卫还躺在河滩边，最好还是救一下他——","id":508},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萌萌香","text":"警察已经去了。","id":509},{"type":"dialog","id":510},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":511},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":512},{"type":"charslot","id":513},{"type":"image","id":514},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8f/Avg_bg_64_g2_jindastreet_n.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":515},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":516},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":517},{"type":"playsound","key":"$rungeneral","volume":"1","id":518},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":519},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1897_1#1$1","posfrom":"200,0","posto":"0,0","duration":"0.5","isblock":"true","id":520},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉星","text":"哟，你们俩在这儿啊。做什么呢？小规模花火大会？","id":521,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/db/Avg_avg_npc_1897_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4199_makiri_1#1$1","id":522},{"type":"dialogue","name":"森内","text":"看样子差不多。","id":523,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/84/Avg_avg_4199_makiri_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4202_haruka_1#3$1","id":524},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萌萌香","text":"毕竟我们这里有一位完全把花火大会给错过去了的人嘛，总该补偿一下的，哈哈。","id":525,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9f/Avg_avg_4202_haruka_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":526},{"type":"charslot","id":527},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_slbell","volume":"1","id":528},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1905_1#1$1","duration":"1.5","id":529},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":530},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1044_hsgma2_1#9$2","id":531},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"（这也是......）","id":532,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7d/Avg_avg_1044_hsgma2_1-9$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"（......神明？）","id":533,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7d/Avg_avg_1044_hsgma2_1-9$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4202_haruka_1#4$1","id":534},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萌萌香","text":"星熊，怎么了？怎么一脸不可思议？又出什么事了吗？","id":535,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6b/Avg_avg_4202_haruka_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1044_hsgma2_1#1$2","id":536},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"不，完全没有。我大概只是......眼花了吧。","id":537,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ed/Avg_avg_1044_hsgma2_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":538},{"type":"charslot","id":539},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_fireworks_small","volume":"0","loop":"true","channel":"fi","id":540},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"0.5","channel":"fi","fadetime":"2","id":541},{"type":"text","text":"星熊觉得那位神明似乎朝自己笑了一下——或者，那位神明本来就一直都在笑。","id":542},{"type":"text","text":"下一个瞬间，那个身影逐渐消失，而萌萌香手中的烟花也一点点烧到根部。","id":543},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"fi","fadetime":"2","id":544},{"type":"text","text":"最后几颗火星遁入虚空。","id":545},{"type":"dialog","id":546},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":547},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":548},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":549},{"type":"charslot","id":550},{"type":"background","id":551},{"type":"image","id":552}],"characters":["悲痛的黑道","星熊","三船","？？？","萌萌香","吉星","森内"]}